{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>U-Hear 是一款結合即時語音辨識、智能聲音偵測與音訊增強的聽力輔助工具，適合聽力欠佳人士、長者，以及需要在會議、講座或嘈雜餐廳中聽清對話的用家。接上 AirPods 或相容耳機後，它可放大環境聲音並直接串流到耳中，帶來類似助聽器的效果。應用程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>即時字幕與智能聲音辨識</h2>\n<p>U-Hear 以簡潔介面配合大字體與清晰排版，不同年齡的用家都能輕鬆操作。它提供即時語音轉文字，讓你實時跟隨對話，並自動分辨講者，令多人交談更易理解。智能聲音辨識會提示門鈴、火警、警報、電話鈴聲、嬰兒哭聲與敲門等重要聲響。用家亦可校準自己的聲音，提升講者分離準確度。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-36-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-37-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-38-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-39-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-40-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：U-Hear: Live Subtitles</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:05.658773+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":347,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T17:29:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:25.354738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:25.354738+00:00","content_hash":"2abb55302cd8d5ce0161a4efbcb3b25ba4a70a84f82ea499345d4a419a40f444","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}